{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13704","headline":"从军行二首 一 · 顾况","name":"从军行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弭节结徒侣，速征赴龙城。\n单于近突围，烽燧屡夜惊。\n长弓挽满月，剑华霜雪明。\n远道百草殒，峭觉寒风生。\n风寒欲砭肌，争奈裘袄轻。\n回首家不见，候雁空中鸣。\n笳奏遝以哀，肃肃趣严程。\n寄语塞外胡，拥骑休横行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}